  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Info</name><text>This scaffold detail view focuses on the ACCT devices. It now exposes 8 ACCT devices and all pairwise differential-current readbacks so the operator-facing PV names and overview layout can stabilize before the final hardware interface is defined.</text><x>20</x><y>56</y><width>860</width><height>56</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0" /></font><transparent>true</transparent><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><actions /><foreground_color><color red="89" green="102" blue="115" /></foreground_color></widget>
