  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Foot</name><text>The IOC now provides all pairwise differential-current PVs for the current 8-device ACCT scaffold. This is still a scaffold beamline layout; if the final lattice ordering or ACCT count changes, the ACCT labels and differential matrix can be updated without changing the operator-facing pattern.</text><x>20</x><y>1024</y><width>1260</width><height>40</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0" /></font><transparent>true</transparent><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><actions /><foreground_color><color red="89" green="102" blue="115" /></foreground_color></widget>
